@startuml
title OC2 | Simulation, Live Preview and Evidence | v2.0.1
actor Operator
participant "DashboardView" as UI
participant "Simulator" as S
participant "DataPlane" as D
participant "Evidence" as E
participant "Local Files" as F
participant "LiveCameraView" as C
participant "AVFoundation" as A
== Synthetic mode ==
Operator -> UI: Run simulation(seed, aperture)
UI -> S: run(Configuration)
S --> UI: [Frame] + [Observation]
UI -> UI: render PupilView
note over D: OC2Event/JSONL contract exists;
not currently invoked by iOS DashboardView
Operator -> UI: Export Signed Evidence
UI -> E: encodeFrames([Frame])
UI -> E: sign(payload, ephemeral Ed25519 key)
E --> UI: EvidenceEnvelope
UI -> F: write frames.json + manifest.json
== Live camera mode (isolated) ==
Operator -> C: Enable preview
C -> A: request camera authorization
alt permission granted
A --> C: local camera preview
else denied
A --> C: no capture
end
note over C,D: No camera pixels or inferred detections
are forwarded to the data plane.
@enduml
